<SiteLayout title="About" description="HaloForge Labs presents Halowin Bubo and its documentation for AMD Strix Halo laptop owners and Windows users.">
  <span class="eyebrow">HaloForge Labs</span>
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p class="intro">HaloForge Labs presents Halowin Bubo and its documentation. Bubo is a native Windows LLM server for AMD Strix Halo laptop owners and Windows users.</p>
  <div class="article-grid">
    <section class="article-body"><h2>Built on gufo</h2><p>Bubo is a fork of <a href="https://github.com/gufo-org/gufo">gufo</a>, the open-source LLM server. The gufo authors provide the upstream server. gufo uses the MIT license.</p><p><a href="/bubo/">Read about Halowin Bubo</a> or <a href="/docs/">open the documentation</a>.</p></section>
    <aside class="margin-note"><span class="eyebrow">For Windows</span><p>AMD Strix Halo.<br />About 70 W.</p></aside>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
